(3580382, 502343, 77340, '<td valign="top">i like the idea... havent thought about it - so simple!!</td>', 'i like the idea... havent thought about it - so simple!!', '2007-04-25 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580383, 502128, 68035, '<td valign="top">Woah, lots of people have gone for the soap bubbles in this challenge, but for me this is the pick of the crop.  Love the lighting effect of having the area where the two bubbles cross more illuminated and the fact that you have avoided the harsh reflections and hot spots that many others have got.  The line in the background is a touch distracting but in no way significantly detracts from a great image - 9</td>', 'Woah, lots of people have gone for the soap bubbles in this challenge, but for me this is the pick of the crop.  Love the lighting effect of having the area where the two bubbles cross more illuminated and the fact that you have avoided the harsh reflections and hot spots that many others have got.  The line in the background is a touch distracting but in no way significantly detracts from a great image - 9', '2007-04-25 06:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580385, 502411, 77340, '<td valign="top">like the idea, but wish i could see more in that bubble...</td>', 'like the idea, but wish i could see more in that bubble...', '2007-04-25 06:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580388, 502630, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic study, great depth of focus to keep both the cat and the bubble so sharp, nice bokeh</td>', 'What a fantastic study, great depth of focus to keep both the cat and the bubble so sharp, nice bokeh', '2007-04-25 06:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580392, 501709, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, great sharpness on the bubble</td>', 'Lovely image, great sharpness on the bubble', '2007-04-25 06:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580398, 500826, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning idea, just which it could have been a bit sharper.  Love the colour</td>', 'Stunning idea, just which it could have been a bit sharper.  Love the colour', '2007-04-25 06:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580456, 501714, 64670, '<td valign="top">If the backdrop was ironed it would be less distracting I think.  Because the person in the photo is striking and deserves the full attention.</td>', 'If the backdrop was ironed it would be less distracting I think.  Because the person in the photo is striking and deserves the full attention.', '2007-04-25 07:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580470, 502543, 51538, '<td valign="top">A sense of freedom in your photo...</td>', 'A sense of freedom in your photo...', '2007-04-25 07:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580481, 502330, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely Escher-like.  The reflections are interesting. 8.</td>', 'Nicely Escher-like.  The reflections are interesting. 8.', '2007-04-25 07:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580483, 502630, 51538, '<td valign="top">This one stands out for having something going on in the image.  Nice actor too. 8.</td>', 'This one stands out for having something going on in the image.  Nice actor too. 8.', '2007-04-25 07:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580484, 501137, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think your photo is the richest in terms of interest, colour, and focus in this challenge. 8.</td>', 'I think your photo is the richest in terms of interest, colour, and focus in this challenge. 8.', '2007-04-25 07:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580618, 502106, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly made me smile!  A bit of a shame the lighting on the duck isn''t stronger.</td>', 'Certainly made me smile!  A bit of a shame the lighting on the duck isn''t stronger.', '2007-04-25 08:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580620, 502630, 28172, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I love the cat''s expression, the shallow depth of field and sharp focus! 10 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I love the cat''s expression, the shallow depth of field and sharp focus! 10 from me.', '2007-04-25 08:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580622, 499759, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the title.  I do find, ''though, that there isn''t anywhere for my eyes to settle, the photo is kind of uncomfortable to view, if that makes any sense whatsoever (and perhaps it is time I revisited the otician!).</td>', 'I like the concept and the title.  I do find, ''though, that there isn''t anywhere for my eyes to settle, the photo is kind of uncomfortable to view, if that makes any sense whatsoever (and perhaps it is time I revisited the otician!).', '2007-04-25 08:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580623, 501383, 67258, '<td valign="top">Strong composition - nice and bold.  Good and original take on the challenge.</td>', 'Strong composition - nice and bold.  Good and original take on the challenge.', '2007-04-25 08:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580626, 502128, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, there is some serious colour saturation boosting going on here - neat effect!  I would prefer the bubbles to take up more of the frame; for me the negative space doesn''t add anything positive to the photo.</td>', 'Wow, there is some serious colour saturation boosting going on here - neat effect!  I would prefer the bubbles to take up more of the frame; for me the negative space doesn''t add anything positive to the photo.', '2007-04-25 08:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580630, 500537, 67258, '<td valign="top">How many frames did you shoot trying to get this exact moment! Impressive timing.  Super crisp focus, but let down somewhat by the background which makes the bursting bubble quite hard to see.</td>', 'How many frames did you shoot trying to get this exact moment! Impressive timing.  Super crisp focus, but let down somewhat by the background which makes the bursting bubble quite hard to see.', '2007-04-25 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580636, 502694, 67258, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, good use of square format, and good placement within the frame.  I wish the glass was a little cleaner, and the white reflection lets the photo down a little, but possibly not a lot that could have been done to reduce it.</td>', 'Clever idea, good use of square format, and good placement within the frame.  I wish the glass was a little cleaner, and the white reflection lets the photo down a little, but possibly not a lot that could have been done to reduce it.', '2007-04-25 09:03:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3580640, 501536, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, but I find myself trying to turn my head around to view it the other way up.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, but I find myself trying to turn my head around to view it the other way up.', '2007-04-25 09:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580652, 499835, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that this looks much more appealing to parents of babies than it does to other viewers...<br/>Very crisp focus, but on a purely subjective level, I am not keen.</td>', 'I have a feeling that this looks much more appealing to parents of babies than it does to other viewers...Very crisp focus, but on a purely subjective level, I am not keen.', '2007-04-25 09:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580653, 502437, 74533, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but by changing it to one colour you seem to have lost the contrast.  Maybe you could have played with the contrast and to make the bubble stand out a bit more.  Great idea though.</td>', 'I like this photo but by changing it to one colour you seem to have lost the contrast.  Maybe you could have played with the contrast and to make the bubble stand out a bit more.  Great idea though.', '2007-04-25 09:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580663, 500537, 74533, '<td valign="top">Wow, you captured the moment!  How many goes did that take?  Like this photo but wish that the bubble just stood out a bit more.</td>', 'Wow, you captured the moment!  How many goes did that take?  Like this photo but wish that the bubble just stood out a bit more.', '2007-04-25 09:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580665, 502397, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sketch of a large female body! For me, the blue on the left hand side does not add anything to the image, and I would be tempted to crop it out, but an interesting abstract nonetheless.</td>', 'Looks like a sketch of a large female body! For me, the blue on the left hand side does not add anything to the image, and I would be tempted to crop it out, but an interesting abstract nonetheless.', '2007-04-25 09:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580672, 502452, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect this was taken with one hand whilst the other was out-stretched with the bubble blower, as the focus is very soft.</td>', 'I suspect this was taken with one hand whilst the other was out-stretched with the bubble blower, as the focus is very soft.', '2007-04-25 09:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580680, 500637, 67612, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection in the bubble.  I''ll have to try it.</td>', 'I love the reflection in the bubble.  I''ll have to try it.', '2007-04-25 09:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580687, 501614, 35602, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, but image is too oof.  One trick I learned is to use manual focus, then focus on one area, blow bubbles and when they get to the focus point, I snap the pic.  Continuous focus and shutter release also works relatively well.</td>', 'Like the colors, but image is too oof.  One trick I learned is to use manual focus, then focus on one area, blow bubbles and when they get to the focus point, I snap the pic.  Continuous focus and shutter release also works relatively well.', '2007-04-25 09:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580691, 502658, 35602, '<td valign="top">Yes, they are round, but I don''t get bubbles from this.  Nice composition,though, but need slightly better focus.</td>', 'Yes, they are round, but I don''t get bubbles from this.  Nice composition,though, but need slightly better focus.', '2007-04-25 09:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580692, 500631, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2007-04-25 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580696, 500776, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but exposure is too bright on eggs.  Really hard to get good exposure with shadows and bright sun in same image.  Better to try an image like this in more even shade or dim light.</td>', 'Nice idea, but exposure is too bright on eggs.  Really hard to get good exposure with shadows and bright sun in same image.  Better to try an image like this in more even shade or dim light.', '2007-04-25 09:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580702, 502358, 35602, '<td valign="top">Like the different sizes of the bubbles, but seems lackluster in subject.</td>', 'Like the different sizes of the bubbles, but seems lackluster in subject.', '2007-04-25 09:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580715, 502339, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not enough focus on any part of image.  Also, foreground is very distracting.  You did capture the intricate colors created in bubbles, though.</td>', 'Not enough focus on any part of image.  Also, foreground is very distracting.  You did capture the intricate colors created in bubbles, though.', '2007-04-25 09:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580727, 502081, 75185, '<td valign="top">Wow...great idea.</td>', 'Wow...great idea.', '2007-04-25 09:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580751, 501614, 75185, '<td valign="top">Good idea and like the arrangement but it looks slightly out of focus</td>', 'Good idea and like the arrangement but it looks slightly out of focus', '2007-04-25 09:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580842, 501415, 67301, '<td valign="top">A supurb capture and I bet you had lots of fun with it</td>', 'A supurb capture and I bet you had lots of fun with it', '2007-04-25 10:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580851, 502590, 67301, '<td valign="top">great capture love the colour in the bubbles</td>', 'great capture love the colour in the bubbles', '2007-04-25 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580853, 502673, 67301, '<td valign="top">very cool tones</td>', 'very cool tones', '2007-04-25 10:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580861, 501300, 57726, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  A shaper image would have improved this shot.  6.</td>', 'Nice concept.  A shaper image would have improved this shot.  6.', '2007-04-25 10:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580862, 502688, 67301, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but I feel the challenge is bubbles and yet thay are not in focus or the main focal pint in the shot. sorry = 5</td>', 'A nice shot but I feel the challenge is bubbles and yet thay are not in focus or the main focal pint in the shot. sorry = 5', '2007-04-25 10:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3580864, 501957, 67301, '<td valign="top">Strong colours and contrast, the lighting a tad harsh but I still like this shot</td>', 'Strong colours and contrast, the lighting a tad harsh but I still like this shot', '2007-04-25 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
