(3581189, 502471, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is similar to a shot I took last month of my niece at the beach except you got much closer.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=489322" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60614/thumb/489322.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60614/thumb/489322.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60614/thumb/489322.jpg"/></a> <br/>Great minds think a like.  Great capture.  Love the expression on the kids face.  Composition is good.  I like how the rider is off center and is surrounded by sea foam bubbles.  The foam in some areas is a bit bright.  Try a circular polarizer next time and see if that helps bring down some of the bright glare.  Hope this does well.</td>', 'This is similar to a shot I took last month of my niece at the beach except you got much closer. Great minds think a like.  Great capture.  Love the expression on the kids face.  Composition is good.  I like how the rider is off center and is surrounded by sea foam bubbles.  The foam in some areas is a bit bright.  Try a circular polarizer next time and see if that helps bring down some of the bright glare.  Hope this does well.', '2007-04-25 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
