(3582954, 500130, 77364, '<td valign="top">the cross-eyed look sort of freeks me out</td>', 'the cross-eyed look sort of freeks me out', '2007-04-25 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582957, 500759, 77364, '<td valign="top">what is that green thing in the middle?  It''s distracting</td>', 'what is that green thing in the middle?  It''s distracting', '2007-04-25 19:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582982, 502683, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of plans for a NASA Mars Base ... : )</td>', 'Reminds me of plans for a NASA Mars Base ... : )', '2007-04-25 19:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583010, 501709, 75617, '<td valign="top">This looks somewhat of what my pic looked that I entered! Very nice job!</td>', 'This looks somewhat of what my pic looked that I entered! Very nice job!', '2007-04-25 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583036, 499812, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable. Excellent detail on her dress. The shot may be better if she were looking at the bubbles, smiling, with the bubbles in focus.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable. Excellent detail on her dress. The shot may be better if she were looking at the bubbles, smiling, with the bubbles in focus.', '2007-04-25 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583042, 500505, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not having a border at the top edge hurts this picture (may not have been anything you could do about that...)</td>', 'Not having a border at the top edge hurts this picture (may not have been anything you could do about that...)', '2007-04-25 20:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583044, 501639, 77196, '<td valign="top">The model''s hairline is very distracting to me. Awesome huge bubbles - nicely captures rainbow effects.</td>', 'The model''s hairline is very distracting to me. Awesome huge bubbles - nicely captures rainbow effects.', '2007-04-25 20:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583048, 501975, 77196, '<td valign="top">The bubbles are a little hard to see. Excellent composition, feeling of fun and action. Nice sharp focus on the girl, with the background out of focus. This one makes me smile, and truly captures the spirit of the contest - think bubbles. Might have been a bit better if the girl''s eyes were open more.</td>', 'The bubbles are a little hard to see. Excellent composition, feeling of fun and action. Nice sharp focus on the girl, with the background out of focus. This one makes me smile, and truly captures the spirit of the contest - think bubbles. Might have been a bit better if the girl''s eyes were open more.', '2007-04-25 20:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583056, 502466, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of bubbles. I like the darker lighting at the top of the straw. Don''t like the brown/red contrast. Perhaps a different background, or use white milk (but that probably would have lost the contrast of the bubbles'' edges).</td>', 'Nice picture of bubbles. I like the darker lighting at the top of the straw. Don''t like the brown/red contrast. Perhaps a different background, or use white milk (but that probably would have lost the contrast of the bubbles'' edges).', '2007-04-25 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583074, 502614, 77196, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it - the top object is too dark to figure out what it is, so it leaves the rest of the shot without a focal point. There are so many bubbles, it appears more like texture than bubbles. There is nothing in the picture to give you a sense of scale. Is the black object a boat (that might be an oar in the top right corner), or a banana split container?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it - the top object is too dark to figure out what it is, so it leaves the rest of the shot without a focal point. There are so many bubbles, it appears more like texture than bubbles. There is nothing in the picture to give you a sense of scale. Is the black object a boat (that might be an oar in the top right corner), or a banana split container?', '2007-04-25 20:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583084, 500772, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. Great expression (can''t tell whether it is a laugh or pre-cry). Your use of soft focus works against seeing the bubbles clearly.</td>', 'Interesting angle. Great expression (can''t tell whether it is a laugh or pre-cry). Your use of soft focus works against seeing the bubbles clearly.', '2007-04-25 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583088, 502670, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice color, and use of the border. Bubbles are out of focus and more like white spots than bubbles.</td>', 'Nice color, and use of the border. Bubbles are out of focus and more like white spots than bubbles.', '2007-04-25 20:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583098, 501715, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent beautiful, colorful shot. Love the water droplets. Nothing in this shot makes me think bubbles. But I''d hate to run up against this shot in a flower challenge.</td>', 'Excellent beautiful, colorful shot. Love the water droplets. Nothing in this shot makes me think bubbles. But I''d hate to run up against this shot in a flower challenge.', '2007-04-25 20:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583111, 502514, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute, with lots of bubbles. The shot could be improved by cropping closer at the top and right side. You don''t need the entire fixture or dish in the picture to clue the reader into the context, and that dark upper right corner distracts from the picture a lot. I''d try just above the scrub brush and just past mid-green &amp; white plate.</td>', 'Cute, with lots of bubbles. The shot could be improved by cropping closer at the top and right side. You don''t need the entire fixture or dish in the picture to clue the reader into the context, and that dark upper right corner distracts from the picture a lot. I''d try just above the scrub brush and just past mid-green & white plate.', '2007-04-25 20:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583121, 499416, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting against a dark background. The bubbles look out of focus (may be just a side-effect of the lighting). His hand obscures his mouth. Perhaps holding his right hand thumb-out and holding wand lower would allow his mouth to be in the picture.</td>', 'Excellent lighting against a dark background. The bubbles look out of focus (may be just a side-effect of the lighting). His hand obscures his mouth. Perhaps holding his right hand thumb-out and holding wand lower would allow his mouth to be in the picture.', '2007-04-25 20:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583124, 502645, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but without much of a focal point. Picture looks over-processed.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but without much of a focal point. Picture looks over-processed.', '2007-04-25 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583130, 501560, 77196, '<td valign="top">Phoenix-shaped bubble? Nice choice of straw - different enough to immediately identify what it is without it being the most common variety. Nice background without distracting reflections in glass or on background.</td>', 'Phoenix-shaped bubble? Nice choice of straw - different enough to immediately identify what it is without it being the most common variety. Nice background without distracting reflections in glass or on background.', '2007-04-25 20:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583132, 501620, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and contrasts.</td>', 'Nice colors and contrasts.', '2007-04-25 20:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583134, 502630, 74182, '<td valign="top">That must have been really hard to get that shot. Great Job.</td>', 'That must have been really hard to get that shot. Great Job.', '2007-04-25 20:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583141, 501415, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition. Not sure I like the figures, but you have them in an interesting post / arrangement. For me, the extra bubble between the left figure''s tennis racket and arm detracts from the caption. I guess it is a bubbles and not a bubble challenge.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition. Not sure I like the figures, but you have them in an interesting post / arrangement. For me, the extra bubble between the left figure''s tennis racket and arm detracts from the caption. I guess it is a bubbles and not a bubble challenge.', '2007-04-25 20:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583143, 502330, 74182, '<td valign="top">That''s cool.</td>', 'That''s cool.', '2007-04-25 20:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583146, 502631, 77196, '<td valign="top">You virtually lose the bubble in the pink background - at least partially due to the soft focus. Not sure what the object in the bottom right is - saw blade?</td>', 'You virtually lose the bubble in the pink background - at least partially due to the soft focus. Not sure what the object in the bottom right is - saw blade?', '2007-04-25 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583151, 501850, 74182, '<td valign="top">Ok, that is creepy.</td>', 'Ok, that is creepy.', '2007-04-25 20:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583153, 501643, 74182, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2007-04-25 20:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583156, 502017, 74182, '<td valign="top">I wish the mug was in focus instead of the background.</td>', 'I wish the mug was in focus instead of the background.', '2007-04-25 20:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583162, 499812, 74182, '<td valign="top">Hey I think I know who this is. You are on my sister''s team. (noob)  I really like this picture, and if you''ve been voting, you know that a ton of the pictures suck! But not this one. 8!</td>', 'Hey I think I know who this is. You are on my sister''s team. (noob)  I really like this picture, and if you''ve been voting, you know that a ton of the pictures suck! But not this one. 8!', '2007-04-25 20:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583167, 500631, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the surface of the bubble and reflections. While there is no way to avoid having the photographer being a part of this image, it would be better to go one of two directions - self-portrait (camera lower, full face visible - maybe lit slightly), or blend as much as possible (dark shirt, etc.). The white shirt w/black camera strap draws attention. Not sure what the image in the left upper center is (two brighter white dots, larger white circle with red circle in center), but it doesn''t distract too much because it is out of focus.</td>', 'Nice capture of the surface of the bubble and reflections. While there is no way to avoid having the photographer being a part of this image, it would be better to go one of two directions - self-portrait (camera lower, full face visible - maybe lit slightly), or blend as much as possible (dark shirt, etc.). The white shirt w/black camera strap draws attention. Not sure what the image in the left upper center is (two brighter white dots, larger white circle with red circle in center), but it doesn''t distract too much because it is out of focus.', '2007-04-25 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583171, 502444, 77196, '<td valign="top">So washed out, almost loses the bubble. If you didn''t know this was a bubble challenge, what would you think of the picture?</td>', 'So washed out, almost loses the bubble. If you didn''t know this was a bubble challenge, what would you think of the picture?', '2007-04-25 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583176, 502664, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not the best focus, though I like the composition.  Wonder if you had more black behind the bubble if it would make it stand out better.</td>', 'Not the best focus, though I like the composition.  Wonder if you had more black behind the bubble if it would make it stand out better.', '2007-04-25 20:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583178, 502556, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice closed-mouth picture of very cute bubble blower. A smile and open eyes might have made it better. Nice angle, with a uniform blue sky (I presume). I think the drop on the shirt, and the matching pink fingernails add to the shot.</td>', 'Nice closed-mouth picture of very cute bubble blower. A smile and open eyes might have made it better. Nice angle, with a uniform blue sky (I presume). I think the drop on the shirt, and the matching pink fingernails add to the shot.', '2007-04-25 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583179, 502630, 35602, '<td valign="top">Sweet</td>', 'Sweet', '2007-04-25 20:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583181, 502654, 77196, '<td valign="top">Creative lighting. Top is too dark - takes out the top of the bubble.</td>', 'Creative lighting. Top is too dark - takes out the top of the bubble.', '2007-04-25 20:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583184, 502631, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but the bubble is very faded and hard to see.  Did you try backlighting?  Might have made it stand out a little better.</td>', 'Nice try, but the bubble is very faded and hard to see.  Did you try backlighting?  Might have made it stand out a little better.', '2007-04-25 20:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583186, 502471, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a great shot. The bright pink saves an otherwise mostly-white shot.</td>', 'What a great shot. The bright pink saves an otherwise mostly-white shot.', '2007-04-25 20:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583191, 501892, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The sun reflections help the bubbles stay visible - er more visible than they would be otherwise. Tough, tough shot.</td>', 'I like the idea. The sun reflections help the bubbles stay visible - er more visible than they would be otherwise. Tough, tough shot.', '2007-04-25 20:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583192, 502658, 45857, '<td valign="top">Really troubled by the allegory, especially since bubbles are so common place, but its a very good image.</td>', 'Really troubled by the allegory, especially since bubbles are so common place, but its a very good image.', '2007-04-25 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583194, 502606, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not enough bubble.  The main subject here seems to be lilacs.  I know you wanted the sharp focus on the lilacs, but it took away from the idea of the bubble just framing the lilac, which might have worked better.</td>', 'Not enough bubble.  The main subject here seems to be lilacs.  I know you wanted the sharp focus on the lilacs, but it took away from the idea of the bubble just framing the lilac, which might have worked better.', '2007-04-25 20:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583195, 502452, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I don''t think the soft focus / depth of field helps you here.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I don''t think the soft focus / depth of field helps you here.', '2007-04-25 20:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583198, 502337, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and reflections in left bubble. Nice inverted reflection of house. Depth of field helps make this shot.</td>', 'Excellent focus and reflections in left bubble. Nice inverted reflection of house. Depth of field helps make this shot.', '2007-04-25 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583201, 501917, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth of field, use of color. The bubble stands out and is supported by small bubbles.</td>', 'Excellent depth of field, use of color. The bubble stands out and is supported by small bubbles.', '2007-04-25 20:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583203, 502437, 77196, '<td valign="top">The pink / purple hues are unnatural, leaving the viewer nothing familiar to relate to. Very nice bubble and reflection, but shot could probably be improved by a tighter crop. Your focus with this crop is grass and trees (and oh, yeah, a bubble).</td>', 'The pink / purple hues are unnatural, leaving the viewer nothing familiar to relate to. Very nice bubble and reflection, but shot could probably be improved by a tighter crop. Your focus with this crop is grass and trees (and oh, yeah, a bubble).', '2007-04-25 20:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583205, 502543, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice low angle. Excellent lighting. Bubbles clearly visible.</td>', 'Nice low angle. Excellent lighting. Bubbles clearly visible.', '2007-04-25 20:54:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3583208, 500809, 77196, '<td valign="top">Definitely makes you think "bubbles"</td>', 'Definitely makes you think "bubbles"', '2007-04-25 20:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583211, 501378, 77196, '<td valign="top">The sense of motion and unattractive colors don''t help this shot.</td>', 'The sense of motion and unattractive colors don''t help this shot.', '2007-04-25 20:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583213, 501614, 77196, '<td valign="top">The black background and sharp focus, combined with the indistinct refelections and bright colors makes this an excellent shot.</td>', 'The black background and sharp focus, combined with the indistinct refelections and bright colors makes this an excellent shot.', '2007-04-25 20:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583220, 502081, 77196, '<td valign="top">Adorable girl. I think the broad band of grey from top center to bottom left (with very little to disrupt it) works against this picture.</td>', 'Adorable girl. I think the broad band of grey from top center to bottom left (with very little to disrupt it) works against this picture.', '2007-04-25 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583227, 502200, 70078, '<td valign="top">mmm.. indeed! nice focus, good lighting, well done! :)</td>', 'mmm.. indeed! nice focus, good lighting, well done! :)', '2007-04-25 21:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583228, 501850, 77196, '<td valign="top">I find this image intense and disturbing.</td>', 'I find this image intense and disturbing.', '2007-04-25 21:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583237, 500828, 77196, '<td valign="top">Dog''s face too dark.</td>', 'Dog''s face too dark.', '2007-04-25 21:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583251, 500061, 77196, '<td valign="top">Attractive girl, nice pose, your bubbles are needing help.</td>', 'Attractive girl, nice pose, your bubbles are needing help.', '2007-04-25 21:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583257, 501910, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too far away. You could get the same impression with a much tighter shot with less distractions.</td>', 'Too far away. You could get the same impression with a much tighter shot with less distractions.', '2007-04-25 21:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583262, 502343, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Different take on the challenge - a level bubble. Nice focus. Not sure people are going to know what they''re looking at. The basically monochrome with lack of color makes this a fairly plain shot.</td>', 'Nice shot. Different take on the challenge - a level bubble. Nice focus. Not sure people are going to know what they''re looking at. The basically monochrome with lack of color makes this a fairly plain shot.', '2007-04-25 21:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583266, 502330, 54540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Certainly will finish high!  Well done.  (I especially appreciate the use of the reflection, causing the bubbles to appear round.)</td>', 'Fantastic!  Certainly will finish high!  Well done.  (I especially appreciate the use of the reflection, causing the bubbles to appear round.)', '2007-04-25 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583269, 502017, 54540, '<td valign="top">Careful - your focus is on the curtain in the background.  Over-ride your camera and manually focus on the bubble in this case.  (I''m guessing it was on automatic focus)  Cute idea though!</td>', 'Careful - your focus is on the curtain in the background.  Over-ride your camera and manually focus on the bubble in this case.  (I''m guessing it was on automatic focus)  Cute idea though!', '2007-04-25 21:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583276, 502590, 54540, '<td valign="top">Wow, I see him!  Nice capture.  I like the colors in the bubbles.  For my preferences, I would like to see the bubbles just ''slightly'' sharper, but a good capture!</td>', 'Wow, I see him!  Nice capture.  I like the colors in the bubbles.  For my preferences, I would like to see the bubbles just ''slightly'' sharper, but a good capture!', '2007-04-25 21:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583278, 501027, 54540, '<td valign="top">Bubbles, without a doubt!</td>', 'Bubbles, without a doubt!', '2007-04-25 21:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583280, 502337, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus - my eye went straight to the foreground bubble.  Good composition as well.</td>', 'Excellent focus - my eye went straight to the foreground bubble.  Good composition as well.', '2007-04-25 21:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583285, 501857, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro of the bubble walls!  I like it.</td>', 'Excellent macro of the bubble walls!  I like it.', '2007-04-25 21:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583287, 501383, 54540, '<td valign="top">Cute play on bubbles!  Extra point!</td>', 'Cute play on bubbles!  Extra point!', '2007-04-25 21:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583290, 502085, 54540, '<td valign="top">Cute expression.  Playful photograph!</td>', 'Cute expression.  Playful photograph!', '2007-04-25 21:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583296, 502444, 54540, '<td valign="top">Great portrait idea.  Perhaps its just me, but the image could be a tad less bright - but I like the composition.  Well done!</td>', 'Great portrait idea.  Perhaps its just me, but the image could be a tad less bright - but I like the composition.  Well done!', '2007-04-25 21:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583300, 502411, 54540, '<td valign="top">Interesting symmetry (sp?) in the image - I like the composition.</td>', 'Interesting symmetry (sp?) in the image - I like the composition.', '2007-04-25 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583337, 500061, 67018, '<td valign="top">Why is she taking a bath in her swimsuit?</td>', 'Why is she taking a bath in her swimsuit?', '2007-04-25 21:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583357, 499782, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture to create a wonderful composition!  The focus seems on, but I would add a touch of sharpening to the image to draw the eye onto the smaller bubble quicker.  Great colors in the background bubble!</td>', 'Excellent capture to create a wonderful composition!  The focus seems on, but I would add a touch of sharpening to the image to draw the eye onto the smaller bubble quicker.  Great colors in the background bubble!', '2007-04-25 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583366, 502631, 54540, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I would focus on the edge of the saw blade to add points to this image.  Good composition.</td>', 'Great idea!  I would focus on the edge of the saw blade to add points to this image.  Good composition.', '2007-04-25 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583397, 502381, 72317, '<td valign="top">Bet that was fun to clean off.<br/>Heh.<br/>Well.. Seems noisy or something. <br/>Nice otherwise.</td>', 'Bet that was fun to clean off.Heh.Well.. Seems noisy or something. Nice otherwise.', '2007-04-25 22:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583400, 502330, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the different lighting and colors reflected off the sphere of bubbles.</td>', 'I like the different lighting and colors reflected off the sphere of bubbles.', '2007-04-25 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583401, 502542, 8624, '<td valign="top">a little soft on the focus - cool idea though to see the scene behind through the bubble</td>', 'a little soft on the focus - cool idea though to see the scene behind through the bubble', '2007-04-25 22:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583404, 501300, 8624, '<td valign="top">fun story being told in this image I like the colors of the tacks, but the image is really fuzzy.</td>', 'fun story being told in this image I like the colors of the tacks, but the image is really fuzzy.', '2007-04-25 22:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583412, 502688, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the softness and b/w image, but her hand is so bright, almost see through and glass like.  It blends too much with the bubbles, for me.  (hence the title?)</td>', 'I love the softness and b/w image, but her hand is so bright, almost see through and glass like.  It blends too much with the bubbles, for me.  (hence the title?)', '2007-04-25 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583414, 501415, 72317, '<td valign="top">Woody!<br/>=D</td>', 'Woody!=D', '2007-04-25 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583416, 502411, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice alignment and cropping.</td>', 'Nice alignment and cropping.', '2007-04-25 22:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583419, 502590, 8624, '<td valign="top">great bubble pattern and cool colors. I like the reflections in the bubbles too. not that crazy about the viewpoint of the girl blowing the bubbles though - seems like a strange angle looking up alongside her jawline.</td>', 'great bubble pattern and cool colors. I like the reflections in the bubbles too. not that crazy about the viewpoint of the girl blowing the bubbles though - seems like a strange angle looking up alongside her jawline.', '2007-04-25 22:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583422, 501115, 72317, '<td valign="top">I tried to get a bubble in one of those things for HOURS.<br/>Kudos to you.<br/>Nine.</td>', 'I tried to get a bubble in one of those things for HOURS.Kudos to you.Nine.', '2007-04-25 22:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583426, 501899, 8624, '<td valign="top">great idea, but presentation could have been better - the wal shadow is pretty harsh and the flag as a table cloth adds too much distraction.</td>', 'great idea, but presentation could have been better - the wal shadow is pretty harsh and the flag as a table cloth adds too much distraction.', '2007-04-25 22:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583427, 502200, 72317, '<td valign="top">Nine.<br/>Gave me cravings.<br/>=P</td>', 'Nine.Gave me cravings.=P', '2007-04-25 22:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583429, 501874, 72317, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes you have.</td>', 'Lovely eyes you have.', '2007-04-25 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583433, 502106, 72317, '<td valign="top">Looks like its drowning almost.<br/>=P</td>', 'Looks like its drowning almost.=P', '2007-04-25 22:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
