(3583789, 502555, 60614, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.  The different shades of purple blends smoothly with the graceful shape of the escaping bubbles.  The top bubble looks like Darth Vader or Chewbacca.  The composition is very nice also.  The crisp focus make the bubbles look solid.  The red glint adds interest and draws your eye to the bubbles.  The tube blends with graceful ease into the bottom bubble which makes them look as one.  Hope this does well.</td>', 'I really love this photo.  The different shades of purple blends smoothly with the graceful shape of the escaping bubbles.  The top bubble looks like Darth Vader or Chewbacca.  The composition is very nice also.  The crisp focus make the bubbles look solid.  The red glint adds interest and draws your eye to the bubbles.  The tube blends with graceful ease into the bottom bubble which makes them look as one.  Hope this does well.', '2007-04-26 00:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
