(3586057, 501620, 63588, '<td valign="top">The bubbles are great - nice dof and "texture" to them. They contrast well with the background. The model''s skin is too smooth...there''s no distinction from when her head/chin ends and her neck begins - it''s all the same tone. Her skinn is too orange me too.</td>', 'The bubbles are great - nice dof and "texture" to them. They contrast well with the background. The model''s skin is too smooth...there''s no distinction from when her head/chin ends and her neck begins - it''s all the same tone. Her skinn is too orange me too.', '2007-04-26 18:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
