(3586080, 501175, 63588, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The harsh shadows on the face are fairly distracting and it would be better if the bubbles were in focus too. Great title - image portrays the bubbles as magic.</td>', 'Nice composition. The harsh shadows on the face are fairly distracting and it would be better if the bubbles were in focus too. Great title - image portrays the bubbles as magic.', '2007-04-26 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
