(3586288, 502547, 63588, '<td valign="top">The partial eye bugs me - not sure what could be done about it b/c I don''t think having any less of the wand would work. Nice conversion and dof.</td>', 'The partial eye bugs me - not sure what could be done about it b/c I don''t think having any less of the wand would work. Nice conversion and dof.', '2007-04-26 20:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
