(3588923, 499462, 77250, '<td valign="top">I like the bubble blurs but the lack of focus detracts from the quality of the image.</td>', 'I like the bubble blurs but the lack of focus detracts from the quality of the image.', '2007-04-27 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588925, 499416, 77250, '<td valign="top">It seems to be a little out of focus.</td>', 'It seems to be a little out of focus.', '2007-04-27 18:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588926, 502017, 77250, '<td valign="top">I wish that the focus was more on the cup and the bubble rather than on the background.  The bubble looks great and the cup looks interesting but the lack of focus makes it so the viewer can''t further examine the image.</td>', 'I wish that the focus was more on the cup and the bubble rather than on the background.  The bubble looks great and the cup looks interesting but the lack of focus makes it so the viewer can''t further examine the image.', '2007-04-27 18:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588929, 501709, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful image.  It is one of two for the entire project that received 10''s from me.  Great colors and tones.  I really enjoy how the colors in the bubble are complimented by the overwhelming green of the grass.  The focus is extremely nice as well.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful image.  It is one of two for the entire project that received 10''s from me.  Great colors and tones.  I really enjoy how the colors in the bubble are complimented by the overwhelming green of the grass.  The focus is extremely nice as well.  Great job.', '2007-04-27 18:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588931, 499782, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph.  The twinkle of light on the sides of the smaller bubble are absolutely perfect.  The colors on the edges of the outer bubble are great too, and the focus (and lack thereof) are perfectly executed.  Great photograph.</td>', 'Very nice photograph.  The twinkle of light on the sides of the smaller bubble are absolutely perfect.  The colors on the edges of the outer bubble are great too, and the focus (and lack thereof) are perfectly executed.  Great photograph.', '2007-04-27 18:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588933, 501998, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I love the green complimented with the slight amounts of yellow and blue.  The only thing that kept this from being a 10 was the blue and green matting.  I don''t feel that it adds anything to your image so I would choose a neutral frame.  Still though, great photo!</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I love the green complimented with the slight amounts of yellow and blue.  The only thing that kept this from being a 10 was the blue and green matting.  I don''t feel that it adds anything to your image so I would choose a neutral frame.  Still though, great photo!', '2007-04-27 18:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588935, 501335, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph.  I love the small bubbles contrasted with the one large bubble.  Great colors and tones as well.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Very nice photograph.  I love the small bubbles contrasted with the one large bubble.  Great colors and tones as well.  Nice photo.', '2007-04-27 18:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588953, 502330, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  I love how simple the outside image is while the inside image is very intricate.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  I love how simple the outside image is while the inside image is very intricate.  Great job.', '2007-04-27 18:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588956, 501830, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very original.  How did you photograph this?</td>', 'Very original.  How did you photograph this?', '2007-04-27 18:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588959, 502009, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  I love the variety in the different bubbles.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  I love the variety in the different bubbles.', '2007-04-27 18:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589045, 501300, 11899, '<td valign="top">I''d like this more if there was more contrast between the background color and the bubble.</td>', 'I''d like this more if there was more contrast between the background color and the bubble.', '2007-04-27 19:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
