(3591450, 502630, 37623, '<td valign="top">i think the best photo of this challenge!  I love it.  it fits the saying "a picture is worth a thousand words".  great shot.</td>', 'i think the best photo of this challenge!  I love it.  it fits the saying "a picture is worth a thousand words".  great shot.', '2007-04-29 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3591461, 501217, 37623, '<td valign="top">I wanna know how you got him to blow a bubble...originality gets an "A"...</td>', 'I wanna know how you got him to blow a bubble...originality gets an "A"...', '2007-04-29 00:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
