(3595857, 502654, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! I don''t really like the border. Also, so little of the photo is in focus that it''s hard to tell what it is at first. But I LOVE the colors and the deep shadows! Neat job!</td>', 'Cool! I don''t really like the border. Also, so little of the photo is in focus that it''s hard to tell what it is at first. But I LOVE the colors and the deep shadows! Neat job!', '2007-04-30 13:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595865, 501892, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! The only thing with this image, is that the background is rather confusing. Some shallow depth of field would be perfect here - to help isolate the bubbles from the background, and making everythign clearer. Very neat idea though! All the colors give it an almost fairy-tale like atmosphere.</td>', 'Neat! The only thing with this image, is that the background is rather confusing. Some shallow depth of field would be perfect here - to help isolate the bubbles from the background, and making everythign clearer. Very neat idea though! All the colors give it an almost fairy-tale like atmosphere.', '2007-04-30 13:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595867, 500452, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract! The lighting is a little harsh though, the highlights are rather blown-out and overly white. Excellent try though! Very good.</td>', 'Cool abstract! The lighting is a little harsh though, the highlights are rather blown-out and overly white. Excellent try though! Very good.', '2007-04-30 13:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595870, 501614, 63269, '<td valign="top">This would be so awesome if the bubbles were in focus!!! I love the vibrant colors against the black background. Good try!</td>', 'This would be so awesome if the bubbles were in focus!!! I love the vibrant colors against the black background. Good try!', '2007-04-30 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595875, 501850, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea! The colors feel a little off... almost like there''s too much red, and then too much of a yellowy gray.  but nice capture never the less.</td>', 'Awesome idea! The colors feel a little off... almost like there''s too much red, and then too much of a yellowy gray.  but nice capture never the less.', '2007-04-30 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595877, 501206, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! Neat idea... I almost feel like I want to get closer to the bubble, to see some more details... a really close macro shot, with the bubble and a wire barb would have been really awesome! Good shot though, nice shallow DOF.</td>', 'Cool! Neat idea... I almost feel like I want to get closer to the bubble, to see some more details... a really close macro shot, with the bubble and a wire barb would have been really awesome! Good shot though, nice shallow DOF.', '2007-04-30 13:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595880, 501975, 63269, '<td valign="top">Sweet. I like kthe simple pastel colors, the background, and the smile on the girl''s face. Very nice!</td>', 'Sweet. I like kthe simple pastel colors, the background, and the smile on the girl''s face. Very nice!', '2007-04-30 13:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
