(3595888, 502610, 63269, '<td valign="top">Way too awesome! I absolutely love how everything appears to be in black and white, except for the front two bubbles... it''s so unique and futuristic looking. Cool, interesting shot!</td>', 'Way too awesome! I absolutely love how everything appears to be in black and white, except for the front two bubbles... it''s so unique and futuristic looking. Cool, interesting shot!', '2007-04-30 13:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
