(3595906, 502572, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors, and neat border! The contrast feels a little harsh, but I love your composition.</td>', 'Very cool colors, and neat border! The contrast feels a little harsh, but I love your composition.', '2007-04-30 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595916, 502291, 63269, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...well, here''s my two cents! :)<br/>This would be a lot better shot maybe if the background and the surroundings of the person weren''t so cluttered. the first thing you''d want to get rid of is that rope hanging right in front of the main subject. Also having the person wear a simple shirt without anything on it might be good - less distracting. The background should probably be perfectly clear, with nothing observable in it. But good try though! :) Interesting idea.</td>', 'Hmmm...well, here''s my two cents! :)This would be a lot better shot maybe if the background and the surroundings of the person weren''t so cluttered. the first thing you''d want to get rid of is that rope hanging right in front of the main subject. Also having the person wear a simple shirt without anything on it might be good - less distracting. The background should probably be perfectly clear, with nothing observable in it. But good try though! :) Interesting idea.', '2007-04-30 13:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595927, 501093, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool idea - but the photo is either much too dark, or needs some adjustments. Maybe the white balance was off or something... but there is nothing white in the photo. The highlights are sort of gray instead of white, making the image look kind of dull and dark. I''ve had this problem too before, and have found that some adjustments with levels in Photoshop REALLY helps! Other than that though, this is pretty neat! Keep trying.</td>', 'Cool idea - but the photo is either much too dark, or needs some adjustments. Maybe the white balance was off or something... but there is nothing white in the photo. The highlights are sort of gray instead of white, making the image look kind of dull and dark. I''ve had this problem too before, and have found that some adjustments with levels in Photoshop REALLY helps! Other than that though, this is pretty neat! Keep trying.', '2007-04-30 13:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595932, 502614, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, I like that it''s in black and white, and I guess it could make a good abstract... but I''m really not sure what this is, and it doesn'' treally seem like all that artistic or photographic of a shot. Neat try though! I like your composition.</td>', 'Well, I like that it''s in black and white, and I guess it could make a good abstract... but I''m really not sure what this is, and it doesn'' treally seem like all that artistic or photographic of a shot. Neat try though! I like your composition.', '2007-04-30 13:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595936, 500723, 63269, '<td valign="top">REally awesome! I love how it looks like selective desaturation. This is very beautiful!</td>', 'REally awesome! I love how it looks like selective desaturation. This is very beautiful!', '2007-04-30 13:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
