(3597165, 501560, 77364, '<td valign="top">I like what you tried to capture.  I could be wrong, but it seems that the clearest, most in focus portion of the photograph is the straw...then the bubbles, then the glass.  If somehow the bubbles where in focus, it could be an excellent attempt.</td>', 'I like what you tried to capture.  I could be wrong, but it seems that the clearest, most in focus portion of the photograph is the straw...then the bubbles, then the glass.  If somehow the bubbles where in focus, it could be an excellent attempt.', '2007-04-30 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597179, 501093, 77364, '<td valign="top">I really like the black background against the pink wine glass.  I know the subject is bubbles, but soap bubbles in a wine glass?  I suppose it is subject to interpreation, but somehow capturing the glass with champagne, selzer, tonic water, 7-Up would have been more in theme with the ''up-scaleness'' of the wine glass against a dramatic background.  Nice otherwise - good try!</td>', 'I really like the black background against the pink wine glass.  I know the subject is bubbles, but soap bubbles in a wine glass?  I suppose it is subject to interpreation, but somehow capturing the glass with champagne, selzer, tonic water, 7-Up would have been more in theme with the ''up-scaleness'' of the wine glass against a dramatic background.  Nice otherwise - good try!', '2007-04-30 19:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597188, 501643, 77364, '<td valign="top">You captured the bubbles and bug nicely.  However, there is so much negative space between the two that the photo seems disjointed.  I do like how the markings on the ladybug mimic the bubbles.  Good try</td>', 'You captured the bubbles and bug nicely.  However, there is so much negative space between the two that the photo seems disjointed.  I do like how the markings on the ladybug mimic the bubbles.  Good try', '2007-04-30 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597195, 500537, 77364, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the bubble breaking.  I am a little distracted by the bubbles off to the right, in the background.  Looking at it makes me want a cranberry and vodka on ice!</td>', 'Excellent capture of the bubble breaking.  I am a little distracted by the bubbles off to the right, in the background.  Looking at it makes me want a cranberry and vodka on ice!', '2007-04-30 19:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597205, 499835, 77364, '<td valign="top">It takes me a moment to figure out what it is that I am actually seeing.  Then, the first thing that my mind figures out is the bubbles (that''s good - that''s the challenge), then I see the lips.  Nice try.</td>', 'It takes me a moment to figure out what it is that I am actually seeing.  Then, the first thing that my mind figures out is the bubbles (that''s good - that''s the challenge), then I see the lips.  Nice try.', '2007-04-30 19:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597216, 500631, 77364, '<td valign="top">Is that a cowboy hat I see in the reflection?  Despite the fact that this is a self portrait (clever idea), I see so many other things as well.  Windows, a chair rail, the hat, etc...  I would like to see this with the right side cropped to eliminate whatever that thing is there that is taking the attention away from you in the bubble.  Very nice idea - keep up the good work.</td>', 'Is that a cowboy hat I see in the reflection?  Despite the fact that this is a self portrait (clever idea), I see so many other things as well.  Windows, a chair rail, the hat, etc...  I would like to see this with the right side cropped to eliminate whatever that thing is there that is taking the attention away from you in the bubble.  Very nice idea - keep up the good work.', '2007-04-30 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597222, 501383, 77364, '<td valign="top">In a contest that is filled with bubbles (literally), this photo was a nice change of pace.  The photo was executed very well.  My next comment is in no way a reflection of your photo - but isn''t it a shame that an awesome, old brick building is littered with neon signs?</td>', 'In a contest that is filled with bubbles (literally), this photo was a nice change of pace.  The photo was executed very well.  My next comment is in no way a reflection of your photo - but isn''t it a shame that an awesome, old brick building is littered with neon signs?', '2007-04-30 19:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597229, 501620, 77364, '<td valign="top">Sexy and innocent all in one.  Red lips and milk.  Nice try.</td>', 'Sexy and innocent all in one.  Red lips and milk.  Nice try.', '2007-04-30 19:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597234, 500840, 77364, '<td valign="top">Interesting, very interesting.  One of those photos that make you take a double take.</td>', 'Interesting, very interesting.  One of those photos that make you take a double take.', '2007-04-30 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597243, 500828, 77364, '<td valign="top">Wow - this dog looks more pathetic than mine when wet.  I showed it to him and explained that he''s not the only dog in the world that gets tortured monthely in the bathroom.  It''s almost a black and white and I like that.  Just for giggles, I wonder how it would look with a coloured tub to make the dog look more ridiculous and pathetic (but in a good way!)  Nicely done.  How wet did you get in the process?</td>', 'Wow - this dog looks more pathetic than mine when wet.  I showed it to him and explained that he''s not the only dog in the world that gets tortured monthely in the bathroom.  It''s almost a black and white and I like that.  Just for giggles, I wonder how it would look with a coloured tub to make the dog look more ridiculous and pathetic (but in a good way!)  Nicely done.  How wet did you get in the process?', '2007-04-30 20:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
