(3599661, 502128, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely colours and oily patterns. Unusual composition too.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely colours and oily patterns. Unusual composition too.', '2007-05-01 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599663, 501709, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Lovely colours and patterns in the oily surface - contrast well with the simple natural green of the grass.</td>', 'Simple but effective. Lovely colours and patterns in the oily surface - contrast well with the simple natural green of the grass.', '2007-05-01 12:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599665, 501917, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Lovely contrast between the warmth of the oranges and the cold blues behind. Great detail in the bubbles, love the thick texture of the liquid (is it melted sugar or something?). Composition nicely balanced too.</td>', 'Beautiful! Lovely contrast between the warmth of the oranges and the cold blues behind. Great detail in the bubbles, love the thick texture of the liquid (is it melted sugar or something?). Composition nicely balanced too.', '2007-05-01 12:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599669, 501857, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of focusing on that distinctive join between bubbles. it provides some lovely lines that contrast well with the more organic shapes (and vibrant colours) of the surface above. I think a deeper depth of field would work better here but like it as is too.</td>', 'I like the idea of focusing on that distinctive join between bubbles. it provides some lovely lines that contrast well with the more organic shapes (and vibrant colours) of the surface above. I think a deeper depth of field would work better here but like it as is too.', '2007-05-01 12:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599689, 501116, 60281, '<td valign="top">A truly fine image. I have no idea why I like this but I do. The subtle colours work very well and the negative space is a refreshing change. I find this a compelling image and am unable to offer an explanation as to why (that is what makes it compelling I guess:-)</td>', 'A truly fine image. I have no idea why I like this but I do. The subtle colours work very well and the negative space is a refreshing change. I find this a compelling image and am unable to offer an explanation as to why (that is what makes it compelling I guess:-)', '2007-05-01 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599712, 502688, 60281, '<td valign="top">Wow gorgeous! This is very different and quite magnificent. An absolutely beautiful expression on her face. The majestic moves into the surreal as my eye moves to the left, it is quite a surprise and works so well. I so wish I had some sort of imagination so that I could come up with anything close to this.</td>', 'Wow gorgeous! This is very different and quite magnificent. An absolutely beautiful expression on her face. The majestic moves into the surreal as my eye moves to the left, it is quite a surprise and works so well. I so wish I had some sort of imagination so that I could come up with anything close to this.', '2007-05-01 13:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
