(3600159, 501871, 34041, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression. excellent lighting in what looks like a very difficult situation.  I think this would make a great "demotivation" poster with a caption something like "Always remember - there are worse jobs than yours"  8 from me.</td>', 'Priceless expression. excellent lighting in what looks like a very difficult situation.  I think this would make a great "demotivation" poster with a caption something like "Always remember - there are worse jobs than yours"  8 from me.', '2007-05-01 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600177, 502011, 34041, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great colours, excellent focus.  I hope this makes the top 10.</td>', 'Wow. Great colours, excellent focus.  I hope this makes the top 10.', '2007-05-01 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600185, 502437, 34041, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  I think your white balance may be a bit off.</td>', 'Oh my.  I think your white balance may be a bit off.', '2007-05-01 14:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600198, 502547, 34041, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Very nice B &amp; W conversion, too.  I''m not a fan of such big borders, but overall a 9 from me</td>', 'Great composition.  Very nice B & W conversion, too.  I''m not a fan of such big borders, but overall a 9 from me', '2007-05-01 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600367, 501093, 59905, '<td valign="top">The DOF is quite amazing to me, was this shot with a tele and the diafragm closed?</td>', 'The DOF is quite amazing to me, was this shot with a tele and the diafragm closed?', '2007-05-01 15:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600379, 500837, 59905, '<td valign="top">Lol, very original!</td>', 'Lol, very original!', '2007-05-01 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600398, 502590, 59905, '<td valign="top">This picture has some nice special parts to it; mainly the non-standard position of the girl''s head, the color change in the bubbles and the reflection (is that what it is?) in the center of the bubbles. Also the bubble stick being yellow is a nice addition.<br/>The only thing I really dislike in this picture is the necklace being slightly out of focus. -7-</td>', 'This picture has some nice special parts to it; mainly the non-standard position of the girl''s head, the color change in the bubbles and the reflection (is that what it is?) in the center of the bubbles. Also the bubble stick being yellow is a nice addition.The only thing I really dislike in this picture is the necklace being slightly out of focus. -7-', '2007-05-01 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600403, 502381, 59905, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, slightly grainy though. -5-</td>', 'Nice composition, slightly grainy though. -5-', '2007-05-01 15:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600409, 502514, 74950, '<td valign="top">a lot of non-interesting things in here... <br/>cropping away the background and leave the duck in its bath would''ve been nice(er).</td>', 'a lot of non-interesting things in here... cropping away the background and leave the duck in its bath would''ve been nice(er).', '2007-05-01 15:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600415, 502632, 74950, '<td valign="top">the dark thing (lower right) is a little distracting...</td>', 'the dark thing (lower right) is a little distracting...', '2007-05-01 15:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600418, 502330, 60281, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC.... my winner so far. A bubble house...</td>', 'FANTASTIC.... my winner so far. A bubble house...', '2007-05-01 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600420, 501415, 59905, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Too bad there are more bubbles than the single large one, I think I''d like it better then. The drops on the floor are a nice diversion of the standard ideally colored gradients-forever type backgrounds. -8-</td>', 'Great idea! Too bad there are more bubbles than the single large one, I think I''d like it better then. The drops on the floor are a nice diversion of the standard ideally colored gradients-forever type backgrounds. -8-', '2007-05-01 15:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600421, 502128, 60281, '<td valign="top">Cool ... its like a pair of planets. The colours are great, you have caught the detail so well. The composition and crop are superb. The background seems to have a lot of colour noise but that is just being excessively picky and running out of anything helpful to say :-)</td>', 'Cool ... its like a pair of planets. The colours are great, you have caught the detail so well. The composition and crop are superb. The background seems to have a lot of colour noise but that is just being excessively picky and running out of anything helpful to say :-)', '2007-05-01 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600424, 501871, 74950, '<td valign="top">yummi... I hope the guy didn''t climb down there just for your shot? ;)</td>', 'yummi... I hope the guy didn''t climb down there just for your shot? ;)', '2007-05-01 15:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600426, 501954, 59905, '<td valign="top">I dislike the lighting, though I might try this effect with a bottle once :P (not making pictures though)</td>', 'I dislike the lighting, though I might try this effect with a bottle once :P (not making pictures though)', '2007-05-01 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600428, 502200, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice image, plenty of bubbles in this one. Very crisp and fresh. I can''t make my mind up about the crop... I think I will have to come back to this one before I give it a final score.<br/> <br/>...Ok, I came back, I decided I like the crop on a second viewing :-) Not so sure about the red pin-stripe around the border though, it seems a bit "cheesy Christmas card" to me tough it wont affect my scoring.</td>', 'Nice image, plenty of bubbles in this one. Very crisp and fresh. I can''t make my mind up about the crop... I think I will have to come back to this one before I give it a final score. ...Ok, I came back, I decided I like the crop on a second viewing :-) Not so sure about the red pin-stripe around the border though, it seems a bit "cheesy Christmas card" to me tough it wont affect my scoring.', '2007-05-01 15:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600430, 500723, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like this! I can''t figure out what is going on, but that is keeping me looking and the more I look, the more I like. It seems the very narrow DOF is the key to this image. Well done.</td>', 'I like this! I can''t figure out what is going on, but that is keeping me looking and the more I look, the more I like. It seems the very narrow DOF is the key to this image. Well done.', '2007-05-01 15:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600432, 502377, 74950, '<td valign="top">nice composition and execution! (though I am rather thinking of "plopp" instead of "bubbles" :))</td>', 'nice composition and execution! (though I am rather thinking of "plopp" instead of "bubbles" :))', '2007-05-01 15:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600433, 502572, 60281, '<td valign="top">An unusual image. I like the stepped tones and the colour. Great composition and the border works well too. Just a hair more sharpening would have helped I think. Overall - excellent.</td>', 'An unusual image. I like the stepped tones and the colour. Great composition and the border works well too. Just a hair more sharpening would have helped I think. Overall - excellent.', '2007-05-01 15:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600434, 502541, 74950, '<td valign="top">crisp and clear</td>', 'crisp and clear', '2007-05-01 15:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600436, 502555, 60281, '<td valign="top">Wow... excelent stuff. I''d like to see a big version of just the main bubble. A simple idea, superbly executed - it will do well I''m sure.</td>', 'Wow... excelent stuff. I''d like to see a big version of just the main bubble. A simple idea, superbly executed - it will do well I''m sure.', '2007-05-01 15:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600441, 502618, 60281, '<td valign="top">A fine composition and wonderfully natural moment. Beautiful use of the full dynamic range, right to the limit. A most excellent result. Excellent control of the background too.</td>', 'A fine composition and wonderfully natural moment. Beautiful use of the full dynamic range, right to the limit. A most excellent result. Excellent control of the background too.', '2007-05-01 15:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600442, 501300, 74950, '<td valign="top">noisy and unsharp... :( <br/>nice idea though!</td>', 'noisy and unsharp... :( nice idea though!', '2007-05-01 15:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600447, 500824, 60281, '<td valign="top">Super image.. nice colours and good strong contrast working well together. Great clarity too.</td>', 'Super image.. nice colours and good strong contrast working well together. Great clarity too.', '2007-05-01 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600448, 502379, 59905, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness, though the main object isn''t bubbles, which I do not like in this specific image. -7- (would''ve been higher if the challenge was frogs or toys or something of the sort)</td>', 'Great sharpness, though the main object isn''t bubbles, which I do not like in this specific image. -7- (would''ve been higher if the challenge was frogs or toys or something of the sort)', '2007-05-01 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600449, 502246, 59905, '<td valign="top">In this picture, I find the bubbles a distraction.</td>', 'In this picture, I find the bubbles a distraction.', '2007-05-01 15:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600451, 501975, 60281, '<td valign="top">A fantastic, fun and spontaneous looking shot. The frozen moment of the girl and bubbles is perfect. The lighting and DOF have worked together to simultaneously isolate the subject yet also place the whole image in context. My eye goes straight to the girl, then to the bubbles and finally goes "wow" at the expanse of the background - it tells a story. Well done</td>', 'A fantastic, fun and spontaneous looking shot. The frozen moment of the girl and bubbles is perfect. The lighting and DOF have worked together to simultaneously isolate the subject yet also place the whole image in context. My eye goes straight to the girl, then to the bubbles and finally goes "wow" at the expanse of the background - it tells a story. Well done', '2007-05-01 15:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600454, 502547, 60281, '<td valign="top">A perfectly executed image with a great composition. The choice of heavy border was a good one I think. Nice clarity and perfect control of dof. Well done!</td>', 'A perfectly executed image with a great composition. The choice of heavy border was a good one I think. Nice clarity and perfect control of dof. Well done!', '2007-05-01 15:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600455, 502555, 59905, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2007-05-01 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600457, 502677, 60281, '<td valign="top">Super! This is the best of this type of image I have seen so far. Several people have tried, but you are the first to have go it right :-) It has the sharpness, the great colours, the contrast, everything.</td>', 'Super! This is the best of this type of image I have seen so far. Several people have tried, but you are the first to have go it right :-) It has the sharpness, the great colours, the contrast, everything.', '2007-05-01 15:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600459, 502630, 60281, '<td valign="top">Lol..  Lovely image! Its just perfect. Exposure, sharpness, controlled background, lighting, its all there with a perfect model and superb timing. You will do well I am sure.</td>', 'Lol..  Lovely image! Its just perfect. Exposure, sharpness, controlled background, lighting, its all there with a perfect model and superb timing. You will do well I am sure.', '2007-05-01 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600462, 502596, 74950, '<td valign="top">hm... big bathtub? :)</td>', 'hm... big bathtub? :)', '2007-05-01 15:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600464, 502624, 60281, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, psychdelic indeed, HFB the LSD substitute. The softness helps the trippy feeling, the whole thing is very well done. I''m impressed and would like to see this much larger.</td>', 'Lovely colours, psychdelic indeed, HFB the LSD substitute. The softness helps the trippy feeling, the whole thing is very well done. I''m impressed and would like to see this much larger.', '2007-05-01 15:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600468, 501093, 60281, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, lovely subtle colours and a nice composition. The lighting seems very well controlled and everything is just right. Its not the most exciting image I have seen but it is very well done.</td>', 'Beautifully done, lovely subtle colours and a nice composition. The lighting seems very well controlled and everything is just right. Its not the most exciting image I have seen but it is very well done.', '2007-05-01 15:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600469, 501643, 59905, '<td valign="top">Great shot, only improvement I can come up with is a slight (positive) brightness adjustment, but overall very nice! -9-</td>', 'Great shot, only improvement I can come up with is a slight (positive) brightness adjustment, but overall very nice! -9-', '2007-05-01 15:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600471, 501917, 60281, '<td valign="top">Super shot! Fab colours (though I am seeing an awful lot of this colour and lighting technique) superb tone and detail. A masterful application of technique, though a slightly uninspired layout.</td>', 'Super shot! Fab colours (though I am seeing an awful lot of this colour and lighting technique) superb tone and detail. A masterful application of technique, though a slightly uninspired layout.', '2007-05-01 15:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600473, 501857, 60281, '<td valign="top">An excellent macro that must have been rather tricky to do. Fantastic patterns and colours. I like the composition, though I think cropping the top 15-20% off may have helped as I do not think that part of the image is contributing anything.</td>', 'An excellent macro that must have been rather tricky to do. Fantastic patterns and colours. I like the composition, though I think cropping the top 15-20% off may have helped as I do not think that part of the image is contributing anything.', '2007-05-01 15:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600475, 499835, 60281, '<td valign="top">Lol. Beautiful tones, good and sharp and a good choice of crop.</td>', 'Lol. Beautiful tones, good and sharp and a good choice of crop.', '2007-05-01 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600477, 501643, 60281, '<td valign="top">An interesting combination of subjects and colours. Just a tiny fraction lighter would have helped I think.</td>', 'An interesting combination of subjects and colours. Just a tiny fraction lighter would have helped I think.', '2007-05-01 15:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600486, 501715, 60281, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, the nice close crop gets the eye straight to the point with no distractions. I suppose some people will argue that they are not bubbles but water droplets. Personally I''m not that pedantic over such things. My biggest criticism is that the image lacks that final bit of sharpness that would make it great. I can''t really tell where the sharpness went but I think you should investigate so you know in the future.</td>', 'Very beautiful, the nice close crop gets the eye straight to the point with no distractions. I suppose some people will argue that they are not bubbles but water droplets. Personally I''m not that pedantic over such things. My biggest criticism is that the image lacks that final bit of sharpness that would make it great. I can''t really tell where the sharpness went but I think you should investigate so you know in the future.', '2007-05-01 15:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600489, 502630, 74950, '<td valign="top">cute cat :) did you plan this shot (nice idea!) or did it just happen spontaneously?</td>', 'cute cat :) did you plan this shot (nice idea!) or did it just happen spontaneously?', '2007-05-01 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600490, 502311, 60281, '<td valign="top">This is a nice dynamic image. I haven''t seen many dynamic bubbles so far. It seems like a little nudge with the top of "levels" may have just brightened it up a little and given it more "ping".</td>', 'This is a nice dynamic image. I haven''t seen many dynamic bubbles so far. It seems like a little nudge with the top of "levels" may have just brightened it up a little and given it more "ping".', '2007-05-01 15:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600492, 500826, 59905, '<td valign="top">Nice one!</td>', 'Nice one!', '2007-05-01 15:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600495, 502072, 60281, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting shapes to look at. Nice colour hues and excellent tonal range. It''s a shame about the little "bits" that speckle the image, they dilute the purity of the image somewhat.</td>', 'Lots of interesting shapes to look at. Nice colour hues and excellent tonal range. It''s a shame about the little "bits" that speckle the image, they dilute the purity of the image somewhat.', '2007-05-01 15:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600497, 501010, 60281, '<td valign="top">Very clever! Like the choice of colour and the tonal range. The light blobs in the background are a minor distraction.</td>', 'Very clever! Like the choice of colour and the tonal range. The light blobs in the background are a minor distraction.', '2007-05-01 15:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600498, 501978, 60281, '<td valign="top">Awesome colours!</td>', 'Awesome colours!', '2007-05-01 15:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600499, 502664, 74950, '<td valign="top">the bubble is out of focus, distracting background</td>', 'the bubble is out of focus, distracting background', '2007-05-01 15:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600502, 501115, 60281, '<td valign="top">A simple, yet interesting image. Nice use of light and a good composition. It doesn''t excite me but it is so well done that I will still score it quite high.</td>', 'A simple, yet interesting image. Nice use of light and a good composition. It doesn''t excite me but it is so well done that I will still score it quite high.', '2007-05-01 15:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600504, 502397, 60281, '<td valign="top">Loverly patterns and clarity, good use of colour too. It looks like there may be a few dirty spots on the bottom of the container, creating the speckled effect within the larger bubbles. They are a tad distracting and take the final edge off an otherwise excellent image.</td>', 'Loverly patterns and clarity, good use of colour too. It looks like there may be a few dirty spots on the bottom of the container, creating the speckled effect within the larger bubbles. They are a tad distracting and take the final edge off an otherwise excellent image.', '2007-05-01 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600507, 502242, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nice image, good compositional balance smooth tones and a nice use of colour. Not so keen on the border, I think plain old black would have been better. As it is the colour and tonal match of the border pull my eye from the frame rather than constraining it within. The border wont affect my score though - borders have to be real awful before I let them influence my score.. lol</td>', 'A nice image, good compositional balance smooth tones and a nice use of colour. Not so keen on the border, I think plain old black would have been better. As it is the colour and tonal match of the border pull my eye from the frame rather than constraining it within. The border wont affect my score though - borders have to be real awful before I let them influence my score.. lol', '2007-05-01 15:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600508, 500759, 74950, '<td valign="top">reminds me of a macro of some animal/skin whatever... :)</td>', 'reminds me of a macro of some animal/skin whatever... :)', '2007-05-01 15:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600510, 501254, 60281, '<td valign="top">Now that must have taken some doing! A great idea, nice composition, great pose, good light balance. The only criticism is that the light is a little harsh and makes the face and hand seem excessively pale.</td>', 'Now that must have taken some doing! A great idea, nice composition, great pose, good light balance. The only criticism is that the light is a little harsh and makes the face and hand seem excessively pale.', '2007-05-01 15:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600513, 502563, 74950, '<td valign="top">the colors, the cropping... I just love it :)</td>', 'the colors, the cropping... I just love it :)', '2007-05-01 15:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600514, 502073, 60281, '<td valign="top">Love this, you have created a real cheeky look. Interesting choice of colour that seems to work well. I''m sure some people will comment on the blown highlights - looks like a deliberate and controlled artistic choice to me and one that works well! Super.</td>', 'Love this, you have created a real cheeky look. Interesting choice of colour that seems to work well. I''m sure some people will comment on the blown highlights - looks like a deliberate and controlled artistic choice to me and one that works well! Super.', '2007-05-01 15:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600516, 502422, 74950, '<td valign="top">seems a little unsharp to me</td>', 'seems a little unsharp to me', '2007-05-01 15:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600518, 501620, 60281, '<td valign="top">A fun and sexy image. A great setup and composition. My biggest criticism is that the lighting seems a little flat. I think the milkshake needs a little more contrast and the models chest a little darker. That would help the image pop out more I think.</td>', 'A fun and sexy image. A great setup and composition. My biggest criticism is that the lighting seems a little flat. I think the milkshake needs a little more contrast and the models chest a little darker. That would help the image pop out more I think.', '2007-05-01 15:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600521, 502358, 74950, '<td valign="top">the the highlighted area in the middle-left is a little distracting...</td>', 'the the highlighted area in the middle-left is a little distracting...', '2007-05-01 15:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600526, 501709, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice bubble. You have caught the colours well. I like the simple composition too -  the central placement works well.</td>', 'Nice bubble. You have caught the colours well. I like the simple composition too -  the central placement works well.', '2007-05-01 15:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600528, 502337, 60281, '<td valign="top">What a great image, the double reflection of the house realy make this image. The reflections held my attention for much longer than the image otherwise would have. The background works superbly too. Well done.</td>', 'What a great image, the double reflection of the house realy make this image. The reflections held my attention for much longer than the image otherwise would have. The background works superbly too. Well done.', '2007-05-01 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600529, 500837, 74950, '<td valign="top">creative idea and nice execution :)</td>', 'creative idea and nice execution :)', '2007-05-01 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600535, 501899, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nice fun image that shows a plan carried through. The main thing letting it down is the lighting. Moving the whole subject further from the background would have helped with the shadow somewhat. Using a second light shining on the background only would have helped too. I think that if the trumpet had been facing the viewer more it would have helped the composition somewhat.</td>', 'A nice fun image that shows a plan carried through. The main thing letting it down is the lighting. Moving the whole subject further from the background would have helped with the shadow somewhat. Using a second light shining on the background only would have helped too. I think that if the trumpet had been facing the viewer more it would have helped the composition somewhat.', '2007-05-01 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600536, 501654, 74950, '<td valign="top">noisy and unsharp</td>', 'noisy and unsharp', '2007-05-01 15:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600537, 502475, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nice simple idea that works very well. I like the smooth colour transition from top to bottom. It could have done with just a few more sharply defined bubbles - but now I''m being picky.</td>', 'A nice simple idea that works very well. I like the smooth colour transition from top to bottom. It could have done with just a few more sharply defined bubbles - but now I''m being picky.', '2007-05-01 15:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600540, 502343, 60281, '<td valign="top">Great title/concept! Love the composition and the simplicity of the whole thing. The focus loos just a tad to far back to me. It may have been interesting to try and get more light into the bubble. If it had been advanced editing I would have said to brighten up the vial and boost its contrast.</td>', 'Great title/concept! Love the composition and the simplicity of the whole thing. The focus loos just a tad to far back to me. It may have been interesting to try and get more light into the bubble. If it had been advanced editing I would have said to brighten up the vial and boost its contrast.', '2007-05-01 15:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600541, 499835, 24013, '<td valign="top">though this is pretty good quality, this type of subject is usually much cuter on my own flesh and blood.</td>', 'though this is pretty good quality, this type of subject is usually much cuter on my own flesh and blood.', '2007-05-01 15:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600542, 502400, 60281, '<td valign="top">Lol lol... A good score for entertainment alone.<br/>White fur in direct sun is always a problem when it comes to exposure. I usually find it takes one or more stops of negative exposure compensation to prevent the white fur from loosing detail, as has happened here.</td>', 'Lol lol... A good score for entertainment alone.White fur in direct sun is always a problem when it comes to exposure. I usually find it takes one or more stops of negative exposure compensation to prevent the white fur from loosing detail, as has happened here.', '2007-05-01 15:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600544, 500160, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like the duo colours and the overall effect. I think a touch of sharpening and a little more contrast would have helped.</td>', 'I like the duo colours and the overall effect. I think a touch of sharpening and a little more contrast would have helped.', '2007-05-01 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600546, 501083, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like this... It will be interesting to read your comments on this one.</td>', 'I like this... It will be interesting to read your comments on this one.', '2007-05-01 15:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600549, 502542, 60281, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! Very clever that I can see the garden through the bubble. It just needed a bit more "ping" to be really great. It needs a little more contrast and a touch of sharpening too.</td>', 'What a great idea! Very clever that I can see the garden through the bubble. It just needed a bit more "ping" to be really great. It needs a little more contrast and a touch of sharpening too.', '2007-05-01 15:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600551, 501660, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice neon bubbles, just a touch lighter may have helped.</td>', 'Nice neon bubbles, just a touch lighter may have helped.', '2007-05-01 15:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600552, 502411, 60281, '<td valign="top">An interesting geometric image. An unusual and effective crop too. Well done.</td>', 'An interesting geometric image. An unusual and effective crop too. Well done.', '2007-05-01 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600553, 502330, 74950, '<td valign="top">nice!<br/>would''ve been even nicer without the reflection of those windows (just a guess... can''t say :)), but may not have been anything you could do about that ;)</td>', 'nice!would''ve been even nicer without the reflection of those windows (just a guess... can''t say :)), but may not have been anything you could do about that ;)', '2007-05-01 15:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600554, 500809, 60281, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s fun yet gentle and the tones are nice. I like the motion blur of the bubbles in the top left. It is a real shame about the loss of detail in the foam on her shoulder. I would have cropped the image just above that point to get rid of the distraction. If it wasn''t for that one thing I think this picture would do much better.</td>', 'I really like this. It''s fun yet gentle and the tones are nice. I like the motion blur of the bubbles in the top left. It is a real shame about the loss of detail in the foam on her shoulder. I would have cropped the image just above that point to get rid of the distraction. If it wasn''t for that one thing I think this picture would do much better.', '2007-05-01 15:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600557, 502411, 59905, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple! I like it that there''s no reflection of a big chunky camera in the bubble ;)</td>', 'Nice and simple! I like it that there''s no reflection of a big chunky camera in the bubble ;)', '2007-05-01 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600558, 502466, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice image and well controlled lighting on the background. I think perhaps a back-light shining through the bubbles would have helped them to have more impact. As the lighting is at the moment my eye is draw to the handle of the mug and that becomes the subject of the image. The lighting simply isn''t balanced from left to right.</td>', 'Nice image and well controlled lighting on the background. I think perhaps a back-light shining through the bubbles would have helped them to have more impact. As the lighting is at the moment my eye is draw to the handle of the mug and that becomes the subject of the image. The lighting simply isn''t balanced from left to right.', '2007-05-01 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600559, 502539, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple picture of bubbles! The composition is good and I like the choice of colour. The focus seems just a little to far back though. With macro it is often a good idea to take a few shots with the focus in very slightly different positions and pick the one that works best later.</td>', 'Nice, simple picture of bubbles! The composition is good and I like the choice of colour. The focus seems just a little to far back though. With macro it is often a good idea to take a few shots with the focus in very slightly different positions and pick the one that works best later.', '2007-05-01 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600561, 502645, 24013, '<td valign="top">it''s not as sharp as would make this top notch, but i love the shape in this.  great abstract.</td>', 'it''s not as sharp as would make this top notch, but i love the shape in this.  great abstract.', '2007-05-01 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600562, 501536, 60281, '<td valign="top">An interesting image with beautiful golden colours and soothing tones. It just seems to lack that little bit of clarity that would take it to the next level. It looks to me as though there is not enough Depth of Field (DOF). On close up shots like this the effect of shallow DOF becomes more pronounced and "stopping down" to a smaller aperture becomes vital at times. Your use of lighting is excellent and was the key to this image, it has given it both form and composition with the gradient tones from top to bottom.</td>', 'An interesting image with beautiful golden colours and soothing tones. It just seems to lack that little bit of clarity that would take it to the next level. It looks to me as though there is not enough Depth of Field (DOF). On close up shots like this the effect of shallow DOF becomes more pronounced and "stopping down" to a smaller aperture becomes vital at times. Your use of lighting is excellent and was the key to this image, it has given it both form and composition with the gradient tones from top to bottom.', '2007-05-01 15:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600575, 501269, 60281, '<td valign="top">My first thought was eyeball! Lots of interesting colours and details going on.<br/>I like the composition, with the slanting line. the heavy black border helps to constrain my eye within the frame. The rectangular reflection in the center is a little off putting as it looks just like a flash head! Its is not the reflection that is the problem, I think it is a good "catch light", it is just that it looks like a flash head. If it is not a flash head then it is just unfortunate, if it is a flash head then I think using some means of disguising its shape would have helped. The fact that I have just been playing around with a flash could have made me over sensitive to this detail but if anyone else says the same thing, then I guess not.. lol</td>', 'My first thought was eyeball! Lots of interesting colours and details going on.I like the composition, with the slanting line. the heavy black border helps to constrain my eye within the frame. The rectangular reflection in the center is a little off putting as it looks just like a flash head! Its is not the reflection that is the problem, I think it is a good "catch light", it is just that it looks like a flash head. If it is not a flash head then it is just unfortunate, if it is a flash head then I think using some means of disguising its shape would have helped. The fact that I have just been playing around with a flash could have made me over sensitive to this detail but if anyone else says the same thing, then I guess not.. lol', '2007-05-01 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600578, 502596, 60281, '<td valign="top">A fun ad well executed image. It seems to lack something, though I''m not sure what. It has a little bit of motion with the movement of the water but I think a bit of "action" would have helped to bring it alive and give it more personality.</td>', 'A fun ad well executed image. It seems to lack something, though I''m not sure what. It has a little bit of motion with the movement of the water but I think a bit of "action" would have helped to bring it alive and give it more personality.', '2007-05-01 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600580, 501593, 60281, '<td valign="top">A well lit, well executed picture. The rotational symmetry gives an interesting composition. The strong mono-colour works well, though I must say I am seeing quite a lot of this technique and it is starting to become a little predictable. While I think the image is good it does not hold my attention for long. Still, a good entry.</td>', 'A well lit, well executed picture. The rotational symmetry gives an interesting composition. The strong mono-colour works well, though I must say I am seeing quite a lot of this technique and it is starting to become a little predictable. While I think the image is good it does not hold my attention for long. Still, a good entry.', '2007-05-01 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600581, 501890, 60281, '<td valign="top">A real cool shot. A classic subject for black and white. The tones on the arm and face seem a little too harsh for me. A much larger aperture to narrow the depth of field would have blurred the brick wall behind and helped to isolate the jazz player.</td>', 'A real cool shot. A classic subject for black and white. The tones on the arm and face seem a little too harsh for me. A much larger aperture to narrow the depth of field would have blurred the brick wall behind and helped to isolate the jazz player.', '2007-05-01 15:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600584, 502339, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nicely executed, simple image. Great use of lighting to create gentle colours and interesting tones. The shallow dof works well. I would have been tempted to crop off the bottom 15% of the picture as it does not seem to contribute anything.</td>', 'A nicely executed, simple image. Great use of lighting to create gentle colours and interesting tones. The shallow dof works well. I would have been tempted to crop off the bottom 15% of the picture as it does not seem to contribute anything.', '2007-05-01 15:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600587, 502381, 60281, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on their faces - it makes me smile every time I look. It looks like the image was over exposed causing the red channel to blow out. That is what has caused the yellowness in the facial highlights. The image also seems rather grainy/noisy as though the ISO was set very high. You score high for creativity but loose some for the technicals I''m afraid.</td>', 'Love the expression on their faces - it makes me smile every time I look. It looks like the image was over exposed causing the red channel to blow out. That is what has caused the yellowness in the facial highlights. The image also seems rather grainy/noisy as though the ISO was set very high. You score high for creativity but loose some for the technicals I''m afraid.', '2007-05-01 15:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600588, 502353, 60281, '<td valign="top">Loads a bubbles. Moody and effective lighting, well executed image but somewhat uninspiring.</td>', 'Loads a bubbles. Moody and effective lighting, well executed image but somewhat uninspiring.', '2007-05-01 15:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600591, 501868, 60281, '<td valign="top">This seems just a tiny bit overexposed, some of the foam has lost all detail in the highlights. Also I think the shutter speed it in "no mans land", that is, it is not quite fast enough to freeze the motion but not slow enought to create a satisfying burred effect. I like the subtle colours.</td>', 'This seems just a tiny bit overexposed, some of the foam has lost all detail in the highlights. Also I think the shutter speed it in "no mans land", that is, it is not quite fast enough to freeze the motion but not slow enought to create a satisfying burred effect. I like the subtle colours.', '2007-05-01 15:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600592, 501560, 60281, '<td valign="top">Thats a wacky bubble! A slightly higher shutter speed would have helped to freeze the motion a dramatically improve the clarity of the image. It would have been better if you could have avoided having the bottom of the glass in the image. A good attempt though, have another go and see if you can get it sharper.</td>', 'Thats a wacky bubble! A slightly higher shutter speed would have helped to freeze the motion a dramatically improve the clarity of the image. It would have been better if you could have avoided having the bottom of the glass in the image. A good attempt though, have another go and see if you can get it sharper.', '2007-05-01 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600593, 501954, 60281, '<td valign="top">An interesting image. The yellow thing in the sink I find to be distracting. I keep trying to figure out what it is but I can''t see enough to tell.</td>', 'An interesting image. The yellow thing in the sink I find to be distracting. I keep trying to figure out what it is but I can''t see enough to tell.', '2007-05-01 15:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600597, 502422, 60281, '<td valign="top">A good capture. You kept it simple and in the proses made it quite surreal. The  white sky in the top right is a little off putting and I think a touch more contrast would have helped.</td>', 'A good capture. You kept it simple and in the proses made it quite surreal. The  white sky in the top right is a little off putting and I think a touch more contrast would have helped.', '2007-05-01 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600598, 500828, 60281, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. She doesn''t look impressed. If it wasn''t a basic editing challenge I would have suggested lightening it up around the eyes.</td>', 'Made me smile. She doesn''t look impressed. If it wasn''t a basic editing challenge I would have suggested lightening it up around the eyes.', '2007-05-01 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600599, 502694, 24013, '<td valign="top">it looks a little dull for the dpc gloss standard, but i really enjoy the composition in this!</td>', 'it looks a little dull for the dpc gloss standard, but i really enjoy the composition in this!', '2007-05-01 15:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600601, 500452, 60281, '<td valign="top">A kaleidoscope indeed... It just seems a little chaotic, but I am at a loss as to how you could fix it. If the whole image had had the clarity that the bubbles in the bottom right have then I think this would have been a really fab image.</td>', 'A kaleidoscope indeed... It just seems a little chaotic, but I am at a loss as to how you could fix it. If the whole image had had the clarity that the bubbles in the bottom right have then I think this would have been a really fab image.', '2007-05-01 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600603, 500772, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nice fun image. I like the composition and the cropping in general. You have caught a good, natural moment. The white balance seems off though. Normal house lighting can be very tricks to get looking right in a photograph. The cameras Auto White balance usually gets it wrong and the incandescent setting is often a mile out too. I have found that the only way to get a good balance indoors is to use manually preset white balance if the camera supports it.</td>', 'A nice fun image. I like the composition and the cropping in general. You have caught a good, natural moment. The white balance seems off though. Normal house lighting can be very tricks to get looking right in a photograph. The cameras Auto White balance usually gets it wrong and the incandescent setting is often a mile out too. I have found that the only way to get a good balance indoors is to use manually preset white balance if the camera supports it.', '2007-05-01 15:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600604, 501639, 60281, '<td valign="top">Now thats a bubble!!! It''s a shame about the background and the flat lighting. A slight change of vantage point or the shallowest dof you could get may have helped with the background. The image is perhaps a touch under-exposed too.</td>', 'Now thats a bubble!!! It''s a shame about the background and the flat lighting. A slight change of vantage point or the shallowest dof you could get may have helped with the background. The image is perhaps a touch under-exposed too.', '2007-05-01 15:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600605, 502437, 60281, '<td valign="top">This image has a nice composition and feeling. The colouration seems a little over done to me, subtler would have been better I think. There is also a lack of contrast for such a bold colourization choice. The contrast may have been ok  with a subtler image.</td>', 'This image has a nice composition and feeling. The colouration seems a little over done to me, subtler would have been better I think. There is also a lack of contrast for such a bold colourization choice. The contrast may have been ok  with a subtler image.', '2007-05-01 15:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600608, 499462, 60281, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame about the white thing (a car?) in the background. It is important to watch for distracting things like that.</td>', 'It''s a shame about the white thing (a car?) in the background. It is important to watch for distracting things like that.', '2007-05-01 15:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600609, 500540, 60281, '<td valign="top">Shining a light into the side of the glass may have helped to give this image a little more pop.</td>', 'Shining a light into the side of the glass may have helped to give this image a little more pop.', '2007-05-01 15:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600611, 501715, 66384, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see the bubbles. It looks like a rose with drops of water. Pretty image though.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see the bubbles. It looks like a rose with drops of water. Pretty image though.', '2007-05-01 15:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600612, 501300, 60281, '<td valign="top">A creative idea! I like the use of coloured pins and the fact that they are not perfectly aligned. The image seems rather noisy (grainy) which is likely the result of a high ISO. Using stronger lighting will allow the camera to use a lower ISO and help to reduce the graininess.</td>', 'A creative idea! I like the use of coloured pins and the fact that they are not perfectly aligned. The image seems rather noisy (grainy) which is likely the result of a high ISO. Using stronger lighting will allow the camera to use a lower ISO and help to reduce the graininess.', '2007-05-01 15:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600614, 502670, 60281, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting an creative image. It seems rather blurry though and I don''t think that helps it. I like the lighting and think this image has a lot of promise.</td>', 'This is an interesting an creative image. It seems rather blurry though and I don''t think that helps it. I like the lighting and think this image has a lot of promise.', '2007-05-01 15:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600616, 499416, 60281, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if you had got closer into the subject. Framing just the bubbles and the mans face and cutting out the lower body that does nothing for the story would have given it more intimacy.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if you had got closer into the subject. Framing just the bubbles and the mans face and cutting out the lower body that does nothing for the story would have given it more intimacy.', '2007-05-01 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600617, 502291, 60281, '<td valign="top">Lol... The lighting seems a little flat and dull. The ribbon/rope thing doesn''t seem to do anything for the image yet it is the first thing I saw.</td>', 'Lol... The lighting seems a little flat and dull. The ribbon/rope thing doesn''t seem to do anything for the image yet it is the first thing I saw.', '2007-05-01 15:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600619, 500749, 60281, '<td valign="top">A simple image that is all about texture. Unfortunately it lacks the absolute clarity that an image of pure texture absolutely needs. I think part of the problem is the focus is slightly off, however the biggest thing that strikes me is the lighting. It looks as thought the image was take around midday, judging by the shadow of the bubbles. Midday usually produces uninspiring lighting as the shadows are very short and textures appear flat. This shot done again when the sun is much lower in the sky would produce a far more pleasing result I''m sure. With natural light it is all about timing.</td>', 'A simple image that is all about texture. Unfortunately it lacks the absolute clarity that an image of pure texture absolutely needs. I think part of the problem is the focus is slightly off, however the biggest thing that strikes me is the lighting. It looks as thought the image was take around midday, judging by the shadow of the bubbles. Midday usually produces uninspiring lighting as the shadows are very short and textures appear flat. This shot done again when the sun is much lower in the sky would produce a far more pleasing result I''m sure. With natural light it is all about timing.', '2007-05-01 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600623, 501378, 60281, '<td valign="top">A slightly faster shutter speed would have helped to freeze the motion of the bubbles and make the image more interesting. The focus is probably to far back as the edge of the pan is good and sharp but that is not the main subject. A spotlight or similar shone directly on the bubbles would likely have helped to give it more drama.</td>', 'A slightly faster shutter speed would have helped to freeze the motion of the bubbles and make the image more interesting. The focus is probably to far back as the edge of the pan is good and sharp but that is not the main subject. A spotlight or similar shone directly on the bubbles would likely have helped to give it more drama.', '2007-05-01 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600634, 501654, 60281, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you were trying to achieve here. The image has problems on every level. I would suggest reading a few beginner articles and perhaps asking in the forums for specific help if you get stuck. People are always willing to help those who are genuine in their desire to learn.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you were trying to achieve here. The image has problems on every level. I would suggest reading a few beginner articles and perhaps asking in the forums for specific help if you get stuck. People are always willing to help those who are genuine in their desire to learn.', '2007-05-01 15:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
