(3600755, 501976, 31399, '<td valign="top">very pretty. think perhaps I''d like the rough areas of earth and twine more noisy or "textural" if that makes ANY sense.  might be a tad more crisp on the "bubble/glass/ball" in front.  gl 7</td>', 'very pretty. think perhaps I''d like the rough areas of earth and twine more noisy or "textural" if that makes ANY sense.  might be a tad more crisp on the "bubble/glass/ball" in front.  gl 7', '2007-05-01 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600777, 501254, 31399, '<td valign="top">okay...from my way of thinking...you''ll ribbon with this shot...BLUE should be in the bag for you.  Nice idea, nicely executed.  only element I''d like different would be more warmth to skin tones...little shine to hair...gl 9</td>', 'okay...from my way of thinking...you''ll ribbon with this shot...BLUE should be in the bag for you.  Nice idea, nicely executed.  only element I''d like different would be more warmth to skin tones...little shine to hair...gl 9', '2007-05-01 16:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600782, 502562, 60281, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the bubble are a bit to bright. I think it would have been better if I could not see the room reflected. You could of controlled the reflections by using a strategically placed piece of card or a sheet.</td>', 'The reflections in the bubble are a bit to bright. I think it would have been better if I could not see the room reflected. You could of controlled the reflections by using a strategically placed piece of card or a sheet.', '2007-05-01 16:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
