(3601877, 502475, 61818, '<td valign="top">By luck or design, this is a wonderful looking combination of the subject matter and the bokeh behind it.  Really lovely, and I don''t find myself using that term often.  Good work.</td>', 'By luck or design, this is a wonderful looking combination of the subject matter and the bokeh behind it.  Really lovely, and I don''t find myself using that term often.  Good work.', '2007-05-01 19:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
