(3605411, 502246, 32761, '<td valign="top">Well thanks for the comments, I agree it should have been in focus.<br/> <br/>As for people not quite understanding the photo, sorry I dont agree, things do not have to be related to make a good photo. As i explain in the description we liked the name.<br/> <br/>Anyway hopefully ill do better next time. Thanks again</td>', 'Well thanks for the comments, I agree it should have been in focus. As for people not quite understanding the photo, sorry I dont agree, things do not have to be related to make a good photo. As i explain in the description we liked the name. Anyway hopefully ill do better next time. Thanks again', '2007-05-02 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
