(3605785, 502630, 44877, '<td valign="top">This blue ribbon is great on so many levels. For one, congratulations - not even 10 entries and you''ve made a huge leap to a 7+ score - wow. And then a cat in first place of a challenge that is not a cat or pet study - go cats!! :o)</td>', 'This blue ribbon is great on so many levels. For one, congratulations - not even 10 entries and you''ve made a huge leap to a 7+ score - wow. And then a cat in first place of a challenge that is not a cat or pet study - go cats!! :o)', '2007-05-02 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3605861, 500637, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well if it is any consolation to you I think this pic scored very low in the challenge.  There were some great images in the challenge and this was one of them....42nd??? No way!!! Should have been much higher</td>', 'Well if it is any consolation to you I think this pic scored very low in the challenge.  There were some great images in the challenge and this was one of them....42nd??? No way!!! Should have been much higher', '2007-05-02 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
