(3608930, 502673, 53278, '<td valign="top">i think what really hurt your score in this one was the sharpness, it seems your pic is slightly out of focus, but then again i see that the upper part was in focus but the lower part was not , so perhaps a different angle or a smaller aperture to increase your depth of field would have done the trick. overall i think it ''s a nice shot.</td>', 'i think what really hurt your score in this one was the sharpness, it seems your pic is slightly out of focus, but then again i see that the upper part was in focus but the lower part was not , so perhaps a different angle or a smaller aperture to increase your depth of field would have done the trick. overall i think it ''s a nice shot.', '2007-05-03 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
