(3611735, 500061, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by summerlovin:</b></div><hr/><i> The point I was trying to make (perhaps in too few words) was that this picture does not seem to be about bubbles, it seems to be more about the model in the bathtub, in a sexual and suggestive pose.  I believe the ratings support my statement.<br/>I believe your model is good looking, except the over-done makeup, messy hair, and over-plucked eyebrows are skanky, not sexy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You could say a lot of pictures are more about something else than another thing, the fact is you can see bubbles in this picture. There was another shot in the challenge of a babies mouth making spit bubbles...Was that more about babies than bubbles? Looking at your profile provides some insight:<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by summerlovin:</b></div><hr/><i>P.S. If you''re going to use a model, use one that looks real and natural. Too much make-up, over-plucked eyebrows, over-colored hair, and nipple piercings are skanky and tasteless. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Seems as though you are a little biased from the beginning, beauty is in the eye of the beholder they say....what may be "skanky" to you may be beautiful to others...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-03 17:36:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by summerlovin: The point I was trying to make (perhaps in too few words) was that this picture does not seem to be about bubbles, it seems to be more about the model in the bathtub, in a sexual and suggestive pose.  I believe the ratings support my statement.I believe your model is good looking, except the over-done makeup, messy hair, and over-plucked eyebrows are skanky, not sexy.   You could say a lot of pictures are more about something else than another thing, the fact is you can see bubbles in this picture. There was another shot in the challenge of a babies mouth making spit bubbles...Was that more about babies than bubbles? Looking at your profile provides some insight:Originally posted by summerlovin:P.S. If you''re going to use a model, use one that looks real and natural. Too much make-up, over-plucked eyebrows, over-colored hair, and nipple piercings are skanky and tasteless.   Seems as though you are a little biased from the beginning, beauty is in the eye of the beholder they say....what may be "skanky" to you may be beautiful to others...', '2007-05-03 18:32:04.000000', '2007-05-03 18:36:22.000000', 0),
