(4137998, 502562, 12448, '<td valign="top">Per the thread:<br/> <br/>This didn''t appeal to me on several levels, one, without the additional comments by you I would have no idea what I''m looking at, LOL :)  I don''t mind abstract but I would at least like to have some sense of something when looking at a shot.<br/>Two, the reflections are very distracting.  You can make your own light box for smaller objects, I think there are instructions around here somewhere.  Okay, not there but here are some instructions: <a href="//www.ourmedia.org/node/253481" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Make your own Lightbox</a> <br/> <br/>You have a great portfolio, it was hard finding one I didn''t really like</td>', 'Per the thread: This didn''t appeal to me on several levels, one, without the additional comments by you I would have no idea what I''m looking at, LOL :)  I don''t mind abstract but I would at least like to have some sense of something when looking at a shot.Two, the reflections are very distracting.  You can make your own light box for smaller objects, I think there are instructions around here somewhere.  Okay, not there but here are some instructions: Make your own Lightbox  You have a great portfolio, it was hard finding one I didn''t really like', '2007-10-03 15:59:21.000000', NULL, 0),
